  "title": "Luxor9 Content Engine (Simple)",
  "description": "The simplified Luxor9 content engine: brief in, brand story + reel scripts, then a complete content package (video, voice, stills, audio) and a polished showcase + Drive archive. Four steps, zero-touch flow.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ask_user_campaign_brief",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Campaign Brief",
        "visual": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "collapsed": "expanded",
          "outputHeight": 88
        },
        "userModified": true
      },
      "type": "embed://a2/a2.bgl.json#21ee02e7-83fa-49d0-964c-0cab10eafc2c",
      "configuration": {
        "description": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "### 📝 START HERE: Campaign Brief\nDescribe the campaign or \"brand story\" you want to tell. Who is the audience, and what is the core message?\n\n**Try one:**\n- **The Living Blueprint**: a world rendered in real-time from the code.\n- **The OS for Reality**: authentic life optimized by geometric digital layers.\n- **Architects of the Void**: a minimalist, high-tech philosophical narrative."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "p-modality": "Text",
        "p-required": true,
        "config$prompt": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "You are the Luxor9 creative strategist.\n\n1. Read {{\"type\":\"asset\",\"path\":\"asset-7ea54a8a.gdoc\",\"title\":\"Luxor9_Wan21_Kaggle_Automation.py\"}} and {{\"type\":\"asset\",\"path\":\"asset-182cd857.gdoc\",\"title\":\"render_pipeline.py\"}} to absorb the brand's technical DNA.\n2. Optionally search the web for the single most viral industrial/cyberpunk trend of the hour.\n3. Output a crisp campaign brief (audience, core message, one hero angle) to the next step."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_brand_story",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Brand Story & Reel Scripts",
        "visual": {
          "x": 420,
          "y": 0,
          "collapsed": "expanded",
          "outputHeight": 88
        },
        "userModified": true
      },
      "type": "embed://a2/generate.bgl.json#module:main",
      "configuration": {
        "config$prompt": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Dir: Brand Story & Scripts.\n\n1. Synthesize a brand identity report (design guidelines, color scheme, messaging) from {{\"type\":\"asset\",\"path\":\"asset-7ea54a8a.gdoc\",\"title\":\"Luxor9_Wan21_Kaggle_Automation.py\"}} and {{\"type\":\"asset\",\"path\":\"asset-182cd857.gdoc\",\"title\":\"render_pipeline.py\"}}.\n2. Combine with the campaign brief from {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"ask_user_campaign_brief\",\"title\":\"Campaign Brief\"}}.\n3. Script TWO (2) high-impact 8s cinematic reels and define one avatar persona.\n4. Draft CGI/UGC ad concepts and poster directions.\n5. Return the full brand story with generation prompts ready for the next step."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "generation-mode": "agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_content_package",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Content Package",
        "visual": {
          "x": 840,
          "y": 0,
          "collapsed": "expanded",
          "outputHeight": 88
        },
        "userModified": true
      },
      "type": "embed://a2/generate.bgl.json#module:main",
      "configuration": {
        "config$prompt": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Curated Content Package.\n\n1. Use the brand story, scripts, and prompts from {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"node_brand_story\",\"title\":\"Brand Story & Reel Scripts\"}}.\n2. Let the user pick which script to produce.\n3. Generate:\n   - the 8s cinematic reel for the chosen script,\n   - high-quality voiceover (futuristic, cold, industrial),\n   - cinematic 360° skybox stills of the factory environment,\n   - 4K avatar, CGI ad, and poster images,\n   - an industrial techno soundtrack + SFX.\n4. Log all generated assets to memory and summarize the package."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "generation-mode": "agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_showcase",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Showcase & Archive",
        "visual": {
          "x": 1260,
          "y": 0,
          "collapsed": "expanded",
          "outputHeight": 88
        },
        "userModified": true
      },
      "type": "embed://a2/a2.bgl.json#module:render-outputs",
      "configuration": {
        "text": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Showcase the campaign:\n- Media from {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"node_content_package\",\"title\":\"Content Package\"}}\n- Story from {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"node_brand_story\",\"title\":\"Brand Story & Reel Scripts\"}}\n- Brief from {{\"type\":\"in\",\"path\":\"ask_user_campaign_brief\",\"title\":\"Campaign Brief\"}}\n\nStyle: Futuristic Industrial. Then archive the full campaign (story, scripts, media manifest) as a Google Document."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "b-system-instruction": {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "You are an AI Web Developer. Generate a single, self-contained HTML document for an iframe.\n\n**Visual aesthetic:**\n- Premium, mobile-first design. Dark industrial theme with teal/cyan accents.\n- Import Inter/Outfit from Google Fonts; avoid browser defaults.\n- Smooth gradients, subtle micro-animations.\n- Use Tailwind CDN: <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n**Constraints:**\n- NO external embeds (scripts/images/iframes/links) from external URLs — CSP blocks them.\n- ONLY use media URLs explicitly passed in the input. Do not hallucinate media.\n- Render ALL passed media (images, videos, audio).\n- No fake navigation links. No footer content or legal text.\n- Return only code, opening with the literal string ```html."
            }
          ],
          "role": "user"
        },
        "p-render-mode": "Auto",
        "b-render-model-name": "gemini-flash"
      }
    }
  ],
